  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $f^{\\prime}(x)=4 x^3-12 x^2+8 x=4 x\\left(x^2-3 x+2\\right)$ $=4 x(x-1)(x-2)$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/6You11xVNQTvEv3V-Kr7dByN8ErWc_z_fu_w68NhJoU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{x}$ is decreasing for $\\mathrm{x} \\in(1,2)$",
